{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_01",
  "title": "特里蒙街道",
  "storyCode": "DV-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f8e4b6f8bc289a7987fbd6da1c4fd4b4c76553481c32f5643e9fea96f130a824",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g8_alley_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//战斗音乐\n//预约替换沉重的机器脚步"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的動力甲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_526_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......難以置信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明明已經啟動了信號干擾，就連可露希爾研發的最新一代無人機都不該偵測到我們的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這動力甲用的是什麼傳感技術？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "能癱瘓它嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本來不想引人注目......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，抓緊些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "百分之十功率，瞄準——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "命中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的動力甲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_526_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "偵測到右側臂甲出現明顯破損。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有減速。在命中的那一刻，它也毫無停頓的跡象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "動力甲裡面是什麼人？他難道不會覺得痛嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的動力甲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_526_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的動力甲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_526_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "左側上臂破損。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "右側小腿破損。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，它沒有對損傷作出任何反應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想讓它停下來，除非我能一擊癱瘓它的動力核心——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可這完全說不通啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算是最訓練有素的士兵，也不可能有這樣的忍耐力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說得沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要是活著的個體，幾乎都做不到完全控制自己最基礎的神經反應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的動力甲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "//机械倒地的声音\n一隻手擊碎了動力甲的中心。無數機械碎片與火花一起噴濺而出，就如同屬於另一種生命形式的血液。\n那隻手很快就收了回去。\n被她的力道帶出來的機甲殘片，與覆在她五指上的純白硬甲一同化作了粉塵，飄灑著落下，在地面上結成薄薄一層鈣質結晶。\n動力甲躺在地上，它的能源之火已經熄滅，軀幹正中留下了一個邊緣齊整的空洞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......徒手擊穿了動力甲的核心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很強的威力，而且確實比我的防禦炮動靜小得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，看來我們不必擔心被當成爆破犯，被那個什麼源石製品管理局帶走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我也不希望羅德島多出新的案底。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我一點都不想念哥倫比亞的拘留室。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "謝謝你，塞雷婭。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必謝我，博士，還有Mechanist先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我將羅德島捲入萊茵內部的事務中——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有義務確保你們不受到任何傷害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g7_mainstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......斐爾迪南猜對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島的人已經見到了塞雷婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要繼續追嗎，女士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假如我把你塞進剛才的動力甲裡，你覺得自己能活下來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必如此緊張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一個假設。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，那個塞雷婭再怎麼厲害，他們也就只有三個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們有這麼多人，還有秘密武器......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "永遠不要低估任何人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和萊茵生命打了這麼久的交道，你還沒學會嗎？看起來越文弱的科學家，說不定揍起人來越狠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您、您是說那個機械師，還有另一個看不見臉的學者嗎？他們難道比萊茵防衛科主任還厲害？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島......人才濟濟啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧。我很喜歡剛才的假設，也有幾個想嘗試一下的新主意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g9_headquarter"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚上好，上校先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......克魯尼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "解釋一下基地的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一些小打小鬧而已......您很清楚，無論我們給的條件多麼優厚，拓荒者們都很難感到滿足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "進取心是他們的優點，是哥倫比亞不斷發展的根基，但偶爾也會造成一些......麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然是麻煩，那麼，解決它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要看到的是你承諾的成果，而不是一則提到萊茵生命的社會新聞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "上校的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要知道，哥倫比亞的科技公司可不止你們一家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請您放心，上校。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊茵生命的產品一定不會讓您失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g3_cottage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "領隊，有好幾個人不想幹了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們說你的法子沒有用，不會有人理睬我們。我們的聲音從來傳不出去，嘗試再多辦法都是白搭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們還說，別管萊茵生命想做什麼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們就該趕緊幹完這份活，領到錢，去下一個地方接著幹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那幾個......失蹤的人，就是他們的命不好。反正那些深入荒野的拓荒隊伍裡，每年死的人比我們這多多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......別說了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告訴其他人，再等一等。我會把我們的同伴帶回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你有什麼打算？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我出去一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要出去？那......那豈不是很危險？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是警方派出了狙擊手，他們會不會就在等你出去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那樣正好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正、正好？你該不會是緊張到大腦錯亂了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "警隊的人是吧？也許是我的老熟人。她用弩射得很準，非要走到最後一步的話，我大概不會太痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桑尼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏比卡博士，摩爾醫生——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我需要你們跟我一起到外面走一趟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何必這麼惺惺作態。我們有說不的權利嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，請再忍耐一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等親眼看到你們的處境，外面的人或許就會改主意，願意更認真地考慮我們的請求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g2_edgeofbase"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "警長，有人出來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無人機射擊準備——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，先停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......警長？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不能傷到人質。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個......赫默醫生，過來一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，是有什麼新情況嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你拿著望遠鏡看一眼，跟在桑......拓荒者身後的人，是不是你的那兩位同事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g1_outdoorbase"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "領隊，通、通訊器亮了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......拿過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "這句話該換我來說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你現在是......警長了吧？我還沒有機會說一聲恭喜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒想到，你會自願在這個轄區待這麼久......拓荒區的麻煩事一直都這麼多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "我也沒想到......你會墮落成這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "你還記得你上過的那些課嗎？那些跟法律相關的課程？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "你還記得......我成為警察的那一天，你都跟我說了些什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "“太好了，我們又是搭檔了，就跟我們小時候玩的遊戲那樣，我們會一起維護哥倫比亞的秩序，將所有罪惡繩之以法——”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "哈......多麼諷刺啊，眼下那個最該被繩之以法的罪犯就是你自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪麗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "你的隊員手裡拿的是什麼東西？自製武器？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "快把那丟人的玩意兒放下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "你把自己作踐成了這副模樣，但你還有選擇。最後的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "放了你身邊那兩位無辜的女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，暫時還不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "該死，你正在一步步走向懸崖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "在哥倫比亞，一名罪犯不想待在監獄裡的話，還能加入拓荒隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "但如果......在拓荒區，他再次違法，他會面臨什麼指控？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "回答我，律師先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別那麼叫我，求你了，瑪麗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "你在逼我後悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "是的，我開始後悔......在你闖進我家裡的那天，我竟然原諒了你，而不是立刻把你抓進警局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那都是過去的事了，那時候我剛剛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我很抱歉，我一直很抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，這一回我做這些是有原因的，請你一定要聽我說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......領隊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個醫生、醫生她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......摩爾醫生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "配置......發生錯誤......修改......電源計畫模式......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟了，喬伊絲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏比卡博士，她怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你可以理解成，她的病發作了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？！礦、礦石病嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快，我扶住她了！她身上有沒有藥？我......我不會注射......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她看起來真的很難受！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我這有萊茵生命配發的緊急醫療環，你們不是說這對礦石病病情有用嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這就給她戴上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你竟然願意把自己的緊急醫療裝置讓給喬伊絲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把這個環給她的話，萬一你也突然病發，你的生存機率會大幅度降低。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生一直對我們很好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一點都不想讓她出事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明綁架我和喬伊絲的人也是你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們並不想忘恩負義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起......我們只是一群自私的普通人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g2_edgeofbase"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......通訊是不是還在繼續？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，我想請您准許我與拓荒者們通話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那位病發的黎博利是我的同事，也是我的好友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更重要的是，我是她的醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想向拓荒者們瞭解一下她的情況。從他們的反應來看，他們對她並非漠不關心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......隨便你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你沒有太多時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我剛收到上頭的指示，要是拓荒者們再不合作，我們會在十分鐘後切斷整個實驗基地的通訊......以及拓荒者生活區的供電。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "切、切斷供電？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "荒地上晝夜溫差非常大......等到了半夜，他們會凍得受不了的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，拓荒者裡有不少礦石病晚期患者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們需要醫療設備維繫生命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以這才稱得上警告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們得看到萊茵生命和警方的決心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有抗爭和訴求都必須建立在合法的基礎上......一旦走上了犯罪道路，就沒有人會聽他們解釋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......您和那位拓荒者領隊不是朋友嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......朋友？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從他自甘墮落的那一刻起，我們之間就再無話可說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g1_outdoorbase"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即時血液結晶密度下來了，眼動指數還是很不正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "眼動指數？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為她的礦石病病灶就在腦部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "任何病情波動都會影響她的神經系統，令她陷入深度睡眠，甚至可能誘發癲癇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃？誰在說話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......通訊器還開著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "你好，領隊先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "我是喬伊絲·摩爾的醫生，我叫赫默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......赫默醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "首先，我想對你表示感謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "有了你和其他拓荒者的幫助，喬伊絲的狀態才能這麼快穩定下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您竟然會對綁架犯說謝謝......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "作為回報，也請你相信我，我們真的很想幫助你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "還有五分鐘，通訊和你們所在生活區的供電就會被同時切斷——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "領隊，突、突然斷電了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "看來他們提前行動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係。我還是該謝謝您願意提醒我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "我從瑪麗女士那裡聽說了，你們想和萊茵生命的高層對話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "我能問問是什麼原因嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想請他們停下這個基地正在進行的實驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "......停止實驗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您和摩爾醫生一樣，也是位好心的醫生。但要停止這麼大的工程，您恐怕做不了主。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您能不能轉告萊茵生命的老總，這個實驗真的很危險？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "桑尼先生，你有沒有證據？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算我有，您又願意相信我......相信一名無路可走的拓荒者嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g2_edgeofbase"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "警長，我們準備好了，隨時可以切斷基地通訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......等赫默醫生說完她想說的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是主任要求通訊必須立刻......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是警長，還是你們萊茵生命的主任是警長？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告訴那個斐爾迪南，怎麼救人是我的事，還輪不到他指手畫腳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "主任已與您的局長打過招呼了，警長。這是他們一起制訂的計畫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "主任......斐爾迪南？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒想到，現在的防衛科也歸能量科管了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是斐爾迪南覺得結構科也是他說了算的話，我不介意立即從萊茵生命辭職。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g3_cottage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白面鴞",
      "speakerId": "avg_128_plosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喬伊絲......喬伊絲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她......睡著了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她徹底失去了意識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不能得到及時治療的話，她......用不了多久就會腦死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "桑尼先生，我準備立刻進入基地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "我理解你的擔憂，所以你放心，我不會攜帶任何武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g2_edgeofbase"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪麗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_527_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，你別做傻事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我很清醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桑尼先生，我也不會讓任何警察......或者防衛科的人跟著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵防衛科成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_528_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫默研究員，我會把你的行動彙報給主任......帕爾維斯主任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我將以羅德島幹員的身份進入359號基地——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格雷伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1027_greyy2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我的電氣工程師同事會與我同行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們會為基地的礦石病患者提供無償的醫療服務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不止是為了我的朋友，也為你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不管萊茵生命會做出什麼選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只知道，救治感染者是羅德島一貫的行為準則。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
